            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"reproducing-hopes-rescaling-and-pruning-claims\">Reproducing HOPE's rescaling and pruning claims</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Verdict: partially reproduced.</strong> Fresh Kubernetes experiments support both selected\nclaims on public pretrained torchvision ResNet-50 and ResNet-18 models evaluated on all\n10,000 ImageNetV2 matched-frequency images. The protocol substitutes ImageNetV2 for the\ngated original ImageNet validation set and does not measure physical speedup.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">This notebook embeds the measured evidence, so opening it does not rerun the expensive\nexperiment. The optional calculator below only evaluates the paper's closed-form kernel.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
