      "id": "bkHC",
      "code_hash": "9ec4401c6ff1b372d6773646372fc7a0",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"headline-result\">Headline result</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Top-1 accuracy on the full public benchmark, without tuning or recalibration:</span></span><marimo-ui-element object-id='bkHC-0' random-id='8d202b7e-3558-92a8-509f-b5a124726f78'><marimo-table data-initial-value='[]' data-label='null' data-data='&quot;[{&#92;&quot;density&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;100%&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;HOPE&#92;&quot;:69.9,&#92;&quot;input-L1&#92;&quot;:69.9,&#92;&quot;joint-L1&#92;&quot;:69.9,&#92;&quot;BN-scale&#92;&quot;:69.9},{&#92;&quot;density&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;95%&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;HOPE&#92;&quot;:66.51,&#92;&quot;input-L1&#92;&quot;:0.11,&#92;&quot;joint-L1&#92;&quot;:14.33,&#92;&quot;BN-scale&#92;&quot;:1.83},{&#92;&quot;density&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;90%&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;HOPE&#92;&quot;:63.42,&#92;&quot;input-L1&#92;&quot;:0.14,&#92;&quot;joint-L1&#92;&quot;:0.36,&#92;&quot;BN-scale&#92;&quot;:0.78},{&#92;&quot;density&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;85%&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;HOPE&#92;&quot;:41.47,&#92;&quot;input-L1&#92;&quot;:0.16,&#92;&quot;joint-L1&#92;&quot;:0.09,&#92;&quot;BN-scale&#92;&quot;:0.22},{&#92;&quot;density&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;80%&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;HOPE&#92;&quot;:9.16,&#92;&quot;input-L1&#92;&quot;:0.18,&#92;&quot;joint-L1&#92;&quot;:0.12,&#92;&quot;BN-scale&#92;&quot;:0.18}]&quot;' data-total-rows='5' data-total-columns='5' data-max-columns='50' data-banner-text='&quot;&quot;' data-pagination='false' data-page-size='10' data-show-filters='false' data-show-download='true' data-show-search='true' data-show-column-summaries='false' data-show-data-types='true' data-show-page-size-selector='false' data-show-column-explorer='true' data-show-chart-builder='true' data-row-headers='[]' data-hidden-columns='[]' data-has-stable-row-id='false' data-lazy='false' data-preload='false'></marimo-table></marimo-ui-element><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>How to read this:</strong> at 90% density, HOPE retained <strong>63.42%</strong> top-1 from a 69.90% baseline; the best comparator retained <strong>0.78%</strong>. At 80%, even HOPE fell to 9.16%, so this evidence supports ordering quality\u2014not robust extreme pruning.</span></span></div>"
