          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"function-preserving-rescaling\">Function-preserving rescaling</h2></span><marimo-ui-element object-id='SFPL-0' random-id='ab25bd28-99a1-5e4a-4d66-7986c5f29a50'><marimo-table data-initial-value='[]' data-label='null' data-data='&quot;[{&#92;&quot;score&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;HOPE&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;bottom-25% overlap&#92;&quot;:1.0,&#92;&quot;Spearman&#92;&quot;:1.0},{&#92;&quot;score&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;input-L1&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;bottom-25% overlap&#92;&quot;:0.542,&#92;&quot;Spearman&#92;&quot;:0.894},{&#92;&quot;score&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;joint-L1&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;bottom-25% overlap&#92;&quot;:0.523,&#92;&quot;Spearman&#92;&quot;:0.828},{&#92;&quot;score&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;BN-scale&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;bottom-25% overlap&#92;&quot;:0.345,&#92;&quot;Spearman&#92;&quot;:0.563}]&quot;' data-total-rows='4' data-total-columns='3' data-max-columns='50' data-banner-text='&quot;&quot;' data-pagination='false' data-page-size='10' data-show-filters='false' data-show-download='true' data-show-search='true' data-show-column-summaries='false' data-show-data-types='true' data-show-page-size-selector='false' data-show-column-explorer='true' data-show-chart-builder='true' data-row-headers='[]' data-hidden-columns='[]' data-has-stable-row-id='false' data-lazy='false' data-preload='false'></marimo-table></marimo-ui-element><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">In the float64 ResNet-50 control, rescaling changed logits by at most <strong>5.65\u00d710\u207b\u00b9\u2076 relative</strong>. HOPE's complete order was identical and its maximum score change was 1.90\u00d710\u207b\u00b9\u2074; all magnitude-based pruning sets changed materially.</span></span></div>"
